  READS: [seam-mappings/crawler-seam-mapping.md#3.4 TimePoint and legacy timestamps, seam-mappings/crawler-seam-mapping.md#3.5 Measurement, seam-mappings/crawler-seam-mapping.md#16.6 Lease behavior]
  EXPOSES: [pub trait ClockAuthority: Send + Sync { fn now(&self) -> Result<CheckedRecord, Fault>; }, pub fn normalize_timestamp(source: &CheckedRecord, clock_evidence: &CheckedRecord) -> Result<CheckedRecord, Fault>, pub fn validate_measurement(measurement: &CheckedRecord, registered_clocks: &CheckedRecord) -> Result<(), Fault>, pub fn compare_deadline(now: &CheckedRecord, deadline: &CheckedRecord) -> Result<std::cmp::Ordering, Fault>]
