  INVARIANTS: [EK-TIME, EK-TIMING-INTERPRETATION, EK-LEASE-RESTART, EXT-TIME-NULL, OWD-TIME-PROVENANCE]
  FORBIDDEN:
    - Subtracting or ordering monotonic offsets across different clock IDs or boots.
